
# Holds the Apps Script /exec URL and token for the build. Kept out of git by the
# project convention this repo inherited -- but NOTE: a clone without it builds a form
# that says "not connected to the sheet" and keeps interviews on the tablet, which is
# exactly what happened on 2026-10-05. If you clone this repo to rebuild, create it
# first: {"url": "<the /exec URL>", "token": "<TOKEN or empty>"} in source/.
source/sync_config.json
source/__pycache__/
source/*.xlsx
source/*.pdf
source/*.md
